<title>USA: AMEX to trade Halter Marine options.</title>
<headline>AMEX to trade Halter Marine options.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said Thursday it would list options on Halter Marine Group Inc shares on April 4.</p>
<p>The options would open with strike prices of 12-1/2, 15 and 17-1/2, with position limits of 4,500 contracts. Initial expirations have been set for April, May, June and September.</p>
<p>The AMEX said Kalb, Voorhis &amp; Co/Cranmer &amp; Cranmer Inc has been named specialist.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
